7", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031330_963175395511870_7978644723259750955_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BnG0zmWOw3AQ7kNvwFqcnCc&_nc_oc=AdnwTOQEns0FYl6x5B8QnZ7TLqd5A8bteuKajzF79GS_zZVKub56XN35b2fEwXASZCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfscN7MJVW-g-hfdKnGPbdofia3se6-ojehKCowmz_Ai_g&oe=699ED1C3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "output-onlinepngtools (17).png", "id": "1440690073248478", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982522_1440690076581811_5977182681337588250_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=95tMHv8Q1EUQ7kNvwH1tQs4&_nc_oc=Adk4khIITUy00gN4AzQZalEGG-EB40J52gVf9dCWrLRvOFOM91uIE-jNJPzpqXZWNqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv946q7KEr_fxzTtM1CReTUWRp3vlRkmX2udyveNX-1PQ&oe=699EE5C8"}, "display_name": "Funny Little Monkeys", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Embark on a wild, gravity-defying adventure in Funny Little Monkeys, the ultimate fan game inspired by the heart-pounding action of Gorilla Tag. Swing through towering urban jungles, dodge obstacles, and outmaneuver your opponents as you navigate a vibrant, neon-lit cityscape. With intuitive controls and exhilarating gameplay, team up with friends or go solo in this adrenaline-fueled race to the top of the leaderboard. Are you ready to unleash your inner primate and become the king of the concrete jungle?", "short_description": "Enter the neon-lit frenzy of Funny Little Monkeys, a thrilling fan game spun from the high-flying antics of Gorilla Tag. Scale towering cityscapes, swing past obstacles, and outsmart rivals in this adrenaline-charged race. With slick controls and multiplayer mayhem, it's a jungle out there\u2014will you rise to the top?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/74c36ae2-e47c-4a1c-a5cc-573745812305", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skibidi Stu